.TH CYAML_DICTIONARY_REMOVE 3 "2026-07-10" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Functions"
.SH NAME
cyaml_dictionary_remove \- remove and free a key from a dictionary node
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <cyaml.h>

ccol_retval_t cyaml_dictionary_remove(cyaml map, const char *key);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
Removes the entry identified by key from the dictionary node map and
recursively frees the associated value subtree.
.fi
.SH RETURN VALUE
.nf
ccol_success        - entry removed and freed.
ccol_invalid_args   - map is NULL or not CYAML_DICTIONARY.
ccol_key_not_found  - key does not exist in the dictionary.
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR cyaml_dictionary_set (3),
.BR cyaml_dictionary_get (3),
.BR cyaml_list_remove (3)
